# ...but the two core VEKN card CSVs are the source of truth CardRegistry
# loads at startup (and CardRegistryTest/CardSearchServiceTest/
# DeckImportServiceTest read from csv/core/ directly) — keep them tracked so
# CI has them without a local-only manual copy step.
!csv/core/
csv/core/*
!csv/core/vtescrypt.csv
!csv/core/vteslib.csv
aws/*

